<title>USA: N.Y. Dorm $60 mln repriced, top yield 5.95 pct.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Dorm $60 mln repriced, top yield 5.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc. said Wednesday it repriced Dormitory Authority of the State of New York's $60 million bond issue for Pace University, adjusting yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2026 unchanged at 5.95 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>DORMITORY AUTHORITY OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $60,000,000*</p>
<p>PACE UNIVERSITY INSURED REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
